<title>USA: Investor holds 6.07 pct ILC stake.</title>
<headline>Investor holds 6.07 pct ILC stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>New York investor Marvin Schwartz said Wednesday he holds a 6.07 percent stake in ILC Technology Inc or 302,700 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Schwartz said the stake includes 109,000 common shares bought between July 22 and August 21 at prices ranging from $11.0625 to $11.9375 per share.</p>
<p>Schwartz bought the shares for investment purposes, the filing said.</p>
